# ACD Sign

Electronic signature web application built with Laravel and Vue.js.

## Features

- Document upload and signature workflow
- Laravel back-end with Vue components
- User and document management

## Tech Stack

- Laravel (Blade)
- PHP
- Shell
- Vue.js

## Getting Started

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ghostland-dev/acd-sign.git
cd acd-sign
cd ACDSign-Back
composer install
cp .env.example .env && php artisan key:generate
php artisan serve
```

